---
// Seção Cardápio da Casa: Bloco institucional direto e minimalista
---

<section id="cardapio" class="py-20 bg-[#FAF6EE] text-[#181412] border-b-2 border-[#181412] relative">
  <div class="max-w-[1380px] w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Bloco Institucional Direto -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-[#181412] shadow-[6px_6px_0px_#181412] text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6">
      
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#181412]">
          CARDÁPIO DA CASA
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-[#524842] font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Lanches, pizzas artesanais, porções e bebidas servidas diretamente na sua pista.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Botão Amplo -->
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a 
          href="/cardapio" 
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-5 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-base sm:text-lg uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-[#181412] hover:bg-[#C41E14] border-2 border-[#181412] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#181412] hover:shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#C41E14] transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 group"
        >
          <span>Acessar Cardápio Completo</span>
          <span class="text-xl group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>


    </div>

  </div>
</section>
